{
  "slug": "common-room",
  "name": "Common Room",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn Common Room into your GTM copilot. Research accounts and contacts, prep for calls with attendee profiles and talking points, and draft personalized outreach across email, LinkedIn, and phone.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **2 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `account-research` (Research a company using Common Room data), `call-prep` (Prepare for a customer or prospect call using Common Room signals), `compose-outreach` (Generate personalized outreach messages using Common Room signals), `contact-research` (Research a specific person using Common Room data), `prospect` (Build targeted account or contact lists using Common Room's Prospector), `weekly-prep-brief` (Generate a comprehensive weekly briefing for all external calls in the next 7 days)\n- **Commands** (2): `generate-account-plan` (Generate a comprehensive strategic account plan), `weekly-brief` (Generate a weekly prep briefing from your calendar and Common Room)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `common-room`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install common-room@knowledge-work-plugins` from `anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins` (`partner-built/common-room`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
